# ---- Video: 206MB across 13 clips ----
# These belong on Cloudflare R2, the way the portfolio serves its reels from
# video.jkmry.com. GitHub Pages is a poor place to serve 206MB of mp4 and the
# repo should not carry it either. Masters stay in this folder locally.
assets/*.mp4

# The delivery encodes, built from those masters: 48MB across 13 clips, a
# quarter the size and what the site actually serves. They go to the R2
# bucket big-apple-greeter-content via tools-upload-video.py, so they do not
# belong here either. The folder name starts with an underscore, which is
# also why .nojekyll has to be committed.
assets/_web/

# ---- Client review artifacts ----
# 70MB of before/after screenshots, generated for review rather than shipped.
comparison/

# ---- Build artifact ----
# The single-file share bundle: every page, video and font base64'd into one
# 20MB html. Regenerated on demand, never edited by hand.
big-apple-greeter-SHARE.html

# ---- OS noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
